    (`A row of the guarantee list` OF 157, "Vũng Tàu", "NHA KHOA HOA SỨ", "54 Cô Giang, phường 4, thành phố Vũng Tàu", FALSE, FALSE, TRUE),   -- [cell:tasco-guarantee-hospitals:248-248]
    (`A row of the guarantee list` OF 158, "Vũng Tàu", "Bệnh viện Vũng Tàu (tên cũ: Bệnh viện Lê Lợi)", "Số 29, đường 2/9, P.11, TP Vũng Tàu", TRUE, TRUE, FALSE),   -- [cell:tasco-guarantee-hospitals:249-251]
    (`A row of the guarantee list` OF 159, "Long An", "Phòng Khám Đa Khoa An Lộc", "04 Trần Văn Nam, Phường 3, Tân An, Long An", FALSE, TRUE, FALSE),   -- [cell:tasco-guarantee-hospitals:252-252]
    (`A row of the guarantee list` OF 160, "Long An", "Nha khoa An Phước", "Số 23 đường Trà Quý Bình, P. 2, Tp. Tân An, Long An.", FALSE, FALSE, TRUE)   -- [cell:tasco-guarantee-hospitals:253-253]

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF `A row of the guarantee list`
`the guarantee-list rows numbered` n MEANS
    filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `number` EQUALS n) `the guarantee list`

-- The three marks of row n, as a list: inpatient, outpatient, dental. A row number that is not in
-- the list gives an empty list.
GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF BOOLEAN
`the marks on guarantee-list row` n MEANS
    concat (map (GIVEN r YIELD LIST (r's `inpatient`), (r's `outpatient`), (r's `dental`)) (`the guarantee-list rows numbered` n))

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A STRING
`the region of guarantee-list row` n MEANS
    CONSIDER `the guarantee-list rows numbered` n
    WHEN r FOLLOWED BY rest THEN r's `region`
    WHEN EMPTY THEN `no such row`

GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`no such row` MEANS REFUSE "the list has no row of that number"

-- Direct billing for inpatient care, outpatient care or dental care at a facility named as the list
-- names it (exact text). A name may appear on more than one row (NHA KHOA NAVII, rows 31 and 32). [in:tasco-guarantee-hospitals]
GIVEN `name` IS A STRING
GIVETH A LIST OF `A row of the guarantee list`
`the guarantee-list rows for the facility named` `name` MEANS
    filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `facility` EQUALS `name`) `the guarantee list`

GIVETH A NUMBER
`the number of facilities offering inpatient direct billing` MEANS
    count (filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `inpatient`) `the guarantee list`)

GIVETH A NUMBER
`the number of facilities offering outpatient direct billing` MEANS
    count (filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `outpatient`) `the guarantee list`)

GIVETH A NUMBER
`the number of facilities offering dental direct billing` MEANS
    count (filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `dental`) `the guarantee list`)
